#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/system/glass.js:39
msgid ""
"Show live system stats (CPU, RAM, network, uptime) in the header. Disable to "
"reduce resource usage on low-end devices."
msgstr ""
"在顶部显示实时系统状态（CPU、内存、网络、运行时间）。在低性能设备上禁用可"
"减少资源占用。"

